@startuml
title MDR-D01 Management Dashboard System Context
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Executive / Operations / Finance / Compliance User" as User

rectangle "Management Dashboard & Reporting" as MDR {
  component "Dashboard Web UI" as UI
  component "Dashboard API / BFF\n(if adopted)" as BFF
  component "Report Catalog\nand Query Facade" as Catalog
}

component "Identity / RBAC" as Identity
component "Central PMS\napproved read models / projections" as Central
component "Audit / Event" as Audit
component "Reconciliation\nread model" as Reconciliation
component "Operator Console\nactivity read model" as OperatorConsole
component "Continuity\nread model" as Continuity
component "Future Fiscal Exception Queue\nread model / navigation handoff" as FiscalQueue
component "External BI / Export Consumers\napproved exports only" as BI

rectangle "Non-direct targets" as NonDirect {
  component "POS Server\nfiscal issuance authority" as PosServer
  component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction" as Payment
  component "Site Integration Adapter" as SIA
  component "Vendor PMS" as Vendor
  component "Gate Integration" as Gate
}

User --> UI : view dashboards,\nrequest reports/exports
UI --> BFF : authenticated dashboard calls
BFF --> Identity : role, scope,\nexport permission
BFF --> Catalog : report/query request
Catalog --> Central : read approved\nprojections
Catalog --> Audit : read audit/report\naccess events
Catalog --> Reconciliation : read reconciliation\nstatus
Catalog --> OperatorConsole : read operator\nactivity summaries
Catalog --> Continuity : read continuity\nstatus
Catalog --> FiscalQueue : read exception\nsummary / handoff
BFF --> BI : controlled export\nwhen authorized

Central ..> PosServer : fiscal evidence recorded\nthrough Central PMS only
Central ..> Payment : provider evidence\nreported through backend
Central ..> SIA : normalized vendor\nprojection feed
SIA ..> Vendor : vendor-specific\nsession/tariff source
Central ..> Gate : authorization/gate\noutcome records

UI -[#red,dashed]-> PosServer : no direct calls
UI -[#red,dashed]-> Payment : no direct calls
UI -[#red,dashed]-> Vendor : no direct calls
UI -[#red,dashed]-> Gate : no direct calls

note bottom of MDR
Dashboard consumes approved projections and read models only.
It does not call POS Server, payment providers, Vendor PMS, or gates directly.
end note
@enduml
